>> a := Ihe ohuru.
>> b := Ihe ohuru.
>> c := a.
Mpụta dee: a adreesị-ebe-nchekwa mkpụrụedemede-niile ? 0, ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: a adreesị-ebe-nchekwa mkpụrụedemede-niile ? 1, ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: a adreesị-ebe-nchekwa = b adreesị-ebe-nchekwa, ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
Mpụta dee: a adreesị-ebe-nchekwa = c adreesị-ebe-nchekwa, ahịrị-ọhụrụ.
